flowchart TB
  Q[List endpoint requirement] --> A{Need random access to page N and total count?}
  A -->|yes, small or medium tenant| O[Offset: page,size,count query. Cost grows with page number]
  A -->|no, infinite scroll or deep browsing| K[Keyset: WHERE created_at,id less than last seen. Cost stays flat]
  O --> O1[Project today: ADR-019, size capped at 100, whitelisted sort + id tie-break]
  K --> K1[Not implemented: needs opaque cursor and contract change]
  O1 --> E1[H2 evidence: offset 40000 examined 50001 rows]
  K1 --> E2[H2 evidence: keyset examined 10001 rows]
